---------------------------------------------------------------------
2. PERMITTED USES  (no permission required)
---------------------------------------------------------------------

(a) Reading the source code for learning purposes.
(b) Cloning the repository to your local machine for personal study.
(c) Running the Next.js application on localhost for evaluation.
(d) Signing in to the hosted instance at https://api.apiboard.dev using
    your own GitHub account, where you may use API keys issued to you
    under the per-key terms shown in the Management tab.
(e) Downloading and running the provided batch files
    (install-apiboard-vs.bat, install-esharp.bat, connect-style-sheets.bat)
    on your own Windows machine for personal use.

